WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.327
Tap-tap-tap! One windy autumn morning, Pip Fox found a little golden leaf on his doorstep.

2
00:00:08.527 --> 00:00:12.428
Oh no, she’s lost her tree! Will you help me find it?

3
00:00:13.778 --> 00:00:15.867
Today, you’ll become a leaf detective!

4
00:00:16.187 --> 00:00:17.906
Learn why leaves change color.

5
00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:24.031
Then, with your grown-up, ask AI to guess a tree from a leaf photo, and check if it’s right.

6
00:00:24.351 --> 00:00:25.976
Next, turn leaves into art.

7
00:00:26.296 --> 00:00:28.711
And at the end, crack Pip’s secret code!

8
00:00:29.911 --> 00:00:35.484
Grab your workbook, your grown-up, and a fallen leaf. Let’s go, detectives!
